title: Add Quint models for pallet-psm

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      Adds formal models of `pallet-psm` in Quint under
      `substrate/frame/psm/designs/quint/`. The models encode the pallet's
      storage invariants, state a bidirectional flow-conservation invariant
      that the `try_state` checks cannot express, and carry a multi-decimal
      regression guard. Documentation only; no runtime code changes.

crates:
  - name: pallet-psm
    bump: none
